# Recon-Default Invariant

## Invariant (one line)

∀ code-work intake — friction classed **feature/bug**, or todo seeded **sparse/early** (`density_triage` unset or `recon_pending`) — the **default front-half is recon** (axis-1 cost ladder; axis-2 skeptic on material) **before** implement. Tier-1 breadth = **Explore subagent** (`Task(subagent_type="explore")`; ¬ tool) per `cheap-recon`.

## Trigger → action

| Condition | Action |
|---|---|
| Operator says "address friction N" where N is a feature/bug | Run recon front-half per `cheap-recon-before-escalation`; ¬ jump to implement |
| Pickup a todo whose `density_triage` is unset or `recon_pending` | Run recon front-half before drafting implement spec |
| Material todo (`judgment_required`) without `skeptic_ratified` attestation | Axis-2 skeptic is binding — `cheap-recon-before-escalation` §Axis-2 |
| `recon_waived="<reason>"` present on entity attrs | Waiver granted — skip axis-2 skeptic only; dense-spec / `files_expected` / acceptance checks still required |

## Exempt set (no recon required)

- Pure **assertion / observation** path (friction *logging* only, knowledge claims)
- `density_triage == "mechanical"` or `"trivial"` scope
- Todo already carries a **dense implement spec** with `files_expected` + `acceptance_criteria`

